Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:44.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:47.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:47.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.85,0:15:57.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
