Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:35.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,廣闊無限的藍天！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:38.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:38.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈衛！
