Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:47.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:47.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}稜鏡愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.17,0:01:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高闊凌雲的勇氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飛翼愈衛！
