Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:32.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鏡平板！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:32.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirrorpad！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.27,0:20:40.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
