Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.97,0:20:46.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不可理喻！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:49.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居然輸給這種弱者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.37,0:20:53.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對要讓你們在我面前卑躬屈膝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:54.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:57.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲 失態了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:21:01.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們奮戰的英姿 讓我很佩服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:04.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我還會來的 虛蜢蜢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:12.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.72,0:21:16.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天都是小空在一直鼓勵我們
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:17.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:20.61,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 小空空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想自己走嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:24.31,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:29.43,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空空空 小空空空空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！是空太郎啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.95,0:21:32.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.09,0:21:33.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,陪你去到天涯海角！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.43,0:21:39.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,空太郎啊 空太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:47.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,給我一個你籃子裡的雲麵包吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.69,0:21:48.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（咕）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:50.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天晚餐吃什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:54.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,煎肉餅 或者炸薯餅？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.59,0:21:56.24,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要吃雲麵包！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:21:57.83,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.01,0:22:01.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.75,0:22:09.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.75,0:22:09.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,970)}飛翼愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.56,0:22:12.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 請試著跟我一起跳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:48.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我參加接力跑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.20,0:23:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 真厲害啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.72,0:23:52.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我不像小晴跑得那麼快...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.57,0:23:54.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在為你加油哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.39,0:23:56.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學絕對可以的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.83,0:23:59.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.83,0:23:59.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.71,0:24:03.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,遞出最棒的一棒！真白全力以赴的接力跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.51,0:02:54.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.31,0:02:59.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:07.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:12.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:16.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:18.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:22.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.13,0:03:27.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:29.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:33.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:37.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:41.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:41.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.02,0:03:43.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:43.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:48.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:53.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:58.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:03.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:06.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:14.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.98,0:22:29.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:34.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:36.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.98,0:22:38.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.81,0:22:41.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.65,0:22:44.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.11,0:22:46.07,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:48.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:51.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.53,0:22:53.20,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.33,0:22:55.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.01,0:23:02.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:08.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:10.60,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.31,0:23:14.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:19.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.24,0:23:25.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.41,0:23:29.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:33.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.75,0:23:37.45,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.45,0:23:38.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.84,0:23:41.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
